    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/2611.15569v1</id>
    <title>TraceKV: Policy-Preserving Low-Rank KV Cache Compression for Reasoning Vision-Language Models</title>
    <updated>2026-11-11T14:54:19Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.15569v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2611.15569v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>Reasoning vision-language models (VLMs) impose substantial KV cache demands from both large multimodal contexts and growing reasoning traces. Low-rank KV compression has emerged as a promising paradigm. Experiments across multiple VLMs achieve near-lossless reasoning accuracy with 5.64$\times$ KV cache compression.</summary>
